# Build context for packaging/Dockerfile. BuildKit reads the ignore file named
# after the Dockerfile, so the filter stays next to the Dockerfile it belongs
# to and the repository root needs no second one.
#
# The two build stages read Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, crates/ and web/admin/.
# Everything else is dropped to keep the context small.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Reference clone and build output.
source
target
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Not read by the build.
oracle
verification
research
briefs
packaging/smoke.sh
packaging/README.md

*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
logs
nohup.out
.DS_Store
